  (text "SAO++ power select: the switch common feeds the LED pads. Position 1 = badge 3.3 V, position 2 = OFF (pin 2 unconnected), position 3 = coin cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "517fde57-feec-5ace-87ee-4d44b6737c17"))
  (text "The badge supply and the coin cell sit on separate switch contacts and are never connected to each other." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e495a7f6-42ce-5529-afc7-15fcc84f33a1"))
  (text "LED-only board: SDA, SCL, GPIO1 and GPIO2 are not connected, so no series diode is needed on the cell (see docs/standard.md section 3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a36a4166-f841-535d-bcd2-6291f295e79a"))
  (text "TP1..TP4 are davedarko's four 4 x 4 mm solder pads, drawn on the board only (bare copper, nothing to buy)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6a22257e-d5af-5ad2-8b78-a64f8eeb34a4"))
  (text "R1 feeds the left arm pad TP4 (ARM_A), R2 the left foot pad TP3 (LEG_A): these are the + pads. The right arm TP2 and right foot TP1 are GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 128.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2c6e571d-80d3-568b-a806-bb06f24e15d0"))
  (text "A hand-soldered 5 mm LED goes across one + pad and one - pad, long leg on +; the maker's 3D-printed konpeito candy" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "28c69894-372c-57b9-afb5-42c6f916dc4b"))
  (text "(original/Soot Sprites/Kompeito.scad) slips over it. 1.3 k gives about 1 mA for a red LED, about 0.4 mA for white or blue on badge power." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 135.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "00a5576d-a659-5984-bbab-151100352e08"))
  (text "Front copper: left half = VLOAD, right half = GND (the maker's two halves, used as power planes as he did)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f83cb474-a7d4-52bb-9f01-36d7c4c8a75f"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
